21
00:02:36,400 --> 00:02:38,518
But we may have to send him packing.

22
00:02:43,760 --> 00:02:47,231
For a second there, I thought
he'd actually figured me out.

23
00:02:47,700 --> 00:02:50,660
But now the poor louse
is half doubting himself.

24
00:02:51,280 --> 00:02:54,398
To top things off, we're in
the middle of the desert.

25
00:02:54,820 --> 00:02:57,800
All I have to do is wait
until they fall asleep.

26
00:02:58,700 --> 00:03:00,700
