29
00:03:07,180 --> 00:03:08,500
This is baby food.

30
00:03:08,980 --> 00:03:12,320
It's a delicious concoction
of milk, egg yolks, bananas,

31
00:03:12,520 --> 00:03:14,337
and bread, all stewed together.

32
00:03:14,420 --> 00:03:15,960
So you want to taste it?

33
00:03:21,100 --> 00:03:21,930
Wow!

34
00:03:22,500 --> 00:03:23,857
This is flat out amazing!

35
00:03:23,940 --> 00:03:24,770
Get me more!

36
00:03:25,340 --> 00:03:26,170
Easy now.

37
00:03:26,253 --> 00:03:29,240
At this rate, there won't
be any left for the baby.

38
00:03:29,720 --> 00:03:31,160
You incompetent bastard!

39
00:03:31,400 --> 00:03:32,871
How dare you eat my food!

40
00:03:32,960 --> 00:03:36,560
I'm wasting away over here, so
hurry up and feed me, dammit!

41
00:03:40,640 --> 00:03:41,517
Ah! It's...

42
00:03:41,600 --> 00:03:42,980
