Mr. Joestar. Polnareff!

51
00:04:24,100 --> 00:04:25,117
Did you see that?

52
00:04:25,200 --> 00:04:26,880
I was right after all.

53
00:04:27,100 --> 00:04:28,453
That baby's not normal.

54
00:04:28,680 --> 00:04:30,800
He just killed a scorpion!

55
00:04:31,180 --> 00:04:32,400
