58
00:04:40,880 --> 00:04:42,557
What the hell are you talking about?

59
00:04:42,640 --> 00:04:43,540
A baby, dammit.

60
00:04:43,760 --> 00:04:45,220
That kid isn't human.

61
00:04:45,520 --> 00:04:47,226
He's not even a year old yet.

62
00:04:47,320 --> 00:04:49,157
But he knew what a scorpion was.

63
00:04:49,240 --> 00:04:51,946
And he killed it with
those tiny hands of his.

64
00:04:52,600 --> 00:04:54,317
A scorpion?

65
