89
00:06:11,740 --> 00:06:14,357
And I have just the thing to prove
to you that I'm not imagining things.

90
00:06:14,440 --> 00:06:15,734
I'm telling the truth!

91
00:06:16,460 --> 00:06:17,880
Do you see these cuts?

92
00:06:18,160 --> 00:06:19,757
