100
00:06:39,473 --> 00:06:41,360
Oh my god!

101
00:06:44,520 --> 00:06:47,640
You colossal buffoon,
how stupid can you be?

102
00:06:48,020 --> 00:06:50,937
Didn't you realize if you showed
them the cuts on your arm,

103
00:06:51,020 --> 00:06:52,667
