105
00:06:54,380 --> 00:06:56,086
Did I make things even worse?

106
00:06:56,960 --> 00:06:59,600
Then it looks like I have no other choice.

107
00:07:00,280 --> 00:07:01,986
It's time for a little force.

108
00:07:03,220 --> 00:07:04,860
I revenge Green!

109
