I'm certain of what I saw.

113
00:07:21,300 --> 00:07:22,597
Jotaro.

114
00:07:22,680 --> 00:07:26,777
His stand was the one
we fought in our dreams.

115
00:07:26,860 --> 00:07:27,837
Polnareff.

116
00:07:27,920 --> 00:07:30,797
We can't fall asleep.

117
00:07:30,880 --> 00:07:31,710
Mr

118
