126
00:07:56,760 --> 00:08:01,466
If he's like this, does that mean Kakyoin
can't fight or travel with us anymore?

127
00:08:02,480 --> 00:08:04,362
We'll discuss it in the morning.

128
00:08:04,660 --> 00:08:05,895
Let's get some sleep.

129
00:08:07,760 --> 00:08:11,080
Polnareff, give me a hand
moving Kakyoin. Sure thing.

130
00:08:11,780 --> 00:08:14,420
Jotaro, you bring the
sleeping bags. Right.

131
00:08:17,380 --> 00:08:18,440
You say something?

132
00:08:18,580 --> 00:08:21,100
No, he's just really heavy.

133
00:08:21,340 --> 00:08:23,257
I've got you right where I want you.

134
00:08:23,340 --> 00:08:27,516
