A horrible one.

145
00:09:14,300 --> 00:09:15,300
This is bad.

146
00:09:15,560 --> 00:09:17,678
We've entered a world of nightmares.

147
00:09:17,860 --> 00:09:19,820
Oh, so it's a dream, huh?

148
00:09:20,220 --> 00:09:22,617
