149
00:09:22,700 --> 00:09:24,994
Don't make the same mistake that I did!

150
00:09:25,280 --> 00:09:29,280
Listen, everything Kakyoin said
to us earlier is true, baby.

151
00:09:30,200 --> 00:09:31,030
Stand.

152
00:09:31,140 --> 00:09:32,880
We are in enemy territory.

153
00:09:33,760 --> 00:09:38,580
I know none of this makes any kind of
sense, but the Stand user is that baby.

154
00:09:43,000 --> 00:09:46,137
There's no one left to wake
you from your slumber now,

155
00:09:46,220 --> 00:09:48,957
and that means there's
absolutely no way for you?

156
00:09:49,040 --> 00:09:50,820
to escape Death 13's world.

157
00:09:53,060 --> 00:09:56,260
I'll finally finish you
off once and for all.

158
00:09:59,720 --> 00:10:02,544
Why did I have to hit
Kakyoin and knock him out?

159
00:10:03,020 --> 00:10:06,220
But since I did that, he
should already be here.

160
00:10:06,420 --> 00:10:07,714
We've got to find him.

161
00:10:07,980 --> 00:10:10,098
Where in the world are you, Kakyoin?

162
00:10:10,200 --> 00:10:12,788
I have to find a way
to make this up to you.

163
00:10:13,840 --> 00:10:16,777
Polareff, good lord, what
is going on with your hair?

164
00:10:16,860 --> 00:10:19,140
Did you mess up brushing it? Huh?

165
00:10:22,760 --> 00:10:24,340
Whoa! Whoa!

166
00:10:28,820 --> 00:10:29,650
Whoa!

167
00:10:30,600 --> 00:10:31,900
Hold the riff!

168
00:10:34,820 --> 00:10:35,650
What the?

169
00:10:36,660 --> 00:10:37,660
Ah!

170
00:10:37,860 --> 00:10:38,860
