174
00:10:52,020 --> 00:10:53,817
It's maddening. Damn!

175
00:10:53,900 --> 00:10:55,997
Anything can happen in this world.

176
00:10:56,080 --> 00:10:57,677
There are no rules here.

177
00:10:57,760 --> 00:10:58,737
Nothing makes sense.

178
00:10:58,820 --> 00:11:01,877
As long as we're in this place,
we're completely at his mercy.

179
00:11:01,960 --> 00:11:03,417
Wait!

180
00:11:03,500 --> 00:11:08,417
I remember there being one
rule: his murder weapon.

181
00:11:08,500 --> 00:11:10,417
If he wants to slice us to pieces,

182
00:11:10,500 --> 00:11:13,197
then you'll have to use his

183
00:11:13,280 --> 00:11:18,100
stand and nothing but his stand.

184
00:11:40,500 --> 00:11:41,330
Star!

185
00:11:41,413 --> 00:11:42,520
Jotaro, it's no use!

186
00:11:42,820 --> 00:11:45,897
It's impossible for us to bring
our stands into this world!

187
00:11:45,980 --> 00:11:46,810
Platinum!

188
00:11:49,360 --> 00:11:50,200
That's weird.

189
00:11:50,540 --> 00:11:51,840
His stand manifested.

190
00:11:58,020 --> 00:11:58,850
Ura!

191
00:12:03,860 --> 00:12:04,820
Ura, kuh.

192
00:12:06,560 --> 00:12:07,390
Ura.

193
00:12:09,020 --> 00:12:09,850
Ura!

194
00:12:10,500 --> 00:12:11,500
Uh-oh.

195
00:12:13,560 --> 00:12:14,390
Uh-oh.

196
00:12:14,473 --> 00:12:15,303
Uh-oh. Uh-oh.

197
00:12:17,420 --> 00:12:18,337
Lally-ho!

198
00:12:18,420 --> 00:12:20,100
Surprise, I'm a fake!

199
00:12:21,440 --> 00:12:23,500
Oh, the overwhelming power!

200
00:12:23,780 --> 00:12:24,960
The absolute terror!

201
00:12:25,220 --> 00:12:26,760
It's so much fun!

202
00:12:27,760 --> 00:12:30,580
A stand is a manifestation of the mind.

203
00:12:30,880 --> 00:12:33,760
And what are dreams if
not the mind laid bare?

204
00:12:34,640 --> 00:12:37,877
My Death 13 has trapped you
within your subconscious,

205
00:12:37,960 --> 00:12:40,960
which is why you can't
summon your precious stands.

206
00:12:43,380 --> 00:12:44,210
Although,

207
00:12:44,293 --> 00:12:48,548
things might be different had you summoned
your stands before you fell asleep.

208
00:12:51,240 --> 00:12:55,597
Then they would have appeared here with
you, just like your clothes, sleeping bags,?

209
00:12:55,680 --> 00:12:57,151
and your prosthetic hand.

210
00:12:57,960 --> 00:13:02,460
Death 13 will never be forced
to face another stand in battle.

211
00:13:02,720 --> 00:13:06,737
And as you know, the only thing that
can defeat a stand is another stand.

212
00:13:06,820 --> 00:13:08,900
so I'll always come out on top!

213
00:13:11,600 --> 00:13:16,120
Now that I have all of you in my
crosshairs, how about you give me a scream?

214
00:13:16,420 --> 00:13:20,832
One that captures the joy and elation
I'm about to feel in my easy victory!

215
00:13:22,020 --> 00:13:23,240
Loli! Oh?

216
00:13:24,040 --> 00:13:24,960
Loli-ho.

217
00:13:25,280 --> 00:13:27,560
Oh, it's just one of the fakes I made.

218
00:13:32,340 --> 00:13:33,170
What?

219
00:13:33,253 --> 00:13:34,460
I don't understand!

220
00:13:34,840 --> 00:13:36,117
This one does...

221
00:13:36,200 --> 00:13:37,400
Hierophant!

222
00:13:41,100 --> 00:13:42,380
It's normal!

223
00:13:43,040 --> 00:13:44,960
Look, it's Kakueen!

224
00:13:45,640 --> 00:13:46,934
Kakueen's right there!

225
00:13:48,060 --> 00:13:50,577
Obviously it slipped your
notice that I'd already summoned

226
00:13:50,660 --> 00:13:53,397
my Hierophant by the time
I was knocked unconscious.

227
00:13:53,480 --> 00:13:54,310
What's more,

228
00:13:54,520 --> 00:13:56,677
I had to burrow underground
to conceal itself

229
00:13:56,760 --> 00:13:59,172
from detection just before I fell asleep.

230
00:14:00,280 --> 00:14:02,120
You can't do this!

231
00:14:02,880 --> 00:14:06,140
Now, it's time for your punishment, baby.

232
00:14:08,940 --> 00:14:10,540
Damn that bastard!

233
00:14:14,140 --> 00:14:15,060
Let's go!

234
00:14:16,280 --> 00:14:17,940
Give up, Death.

235
00:14:18,300 --> 00:14:21,241
I had Hierophant place
himself in your blind spot.

236
00:14:21,640 --> 00:14:24,180
If you keep up this futile struggling...

237
00:14:26,620 --> 00:14:28,517
I really don't care that you're a baby.

238
00:14:28,600 --> 00:14:30,100
